NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MAINMENU"] = "Modify your settings, change your hotkeys or exit the game."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR0"] = "The amount of mana you currently have. Players require mana in order to cast spells. Mana automatically regenerates if you have not cast a spell in the past five seconds."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR1"] = "Warriors (and Druids in Bear Form or Dire Bear Form) require Rage in order to use their abilities."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR2"] = "Hunters require focus to use their abilities.  Focus generates while standing still."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR3"] = "Rogues (and Druids in Cat Form) require Energy in order to use their abilities."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR4"] = "The amount of happiness your pet currently has. Content pets inflict normal damage on their enemies, whereas Happy pets inflict enhanced damage, and unhappy pets inflict reduced damage. Happiness goes down when your pet dies or as it grows hungry, while feeding your pet will increase its happiness."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MEMORY"] = "How much memory your AddOns are using. You can get to the addon management page from the character select screen."
